  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/06/IMG_3391.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">Poco antes de finalizar el curso 2013-14, el colegio P&iacute;o XII de Onda celebr&oacute; su tradicional jornada de puertas abiertas, en viernes por la tarde, con deportes, teatro, esposici&oacute;n de manualidades, bailes y degustaci&oacute;n de horchata.</span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadapuertasabiertaspioxii14/img_3339.jpg\" alt=\"img_3339\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadapuertasabiertaspioxii14/img_3340.jpg\" alt=\"img_3340\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadapuertasabiertaspioxii14/img_3341.jpg\" alt=\"img_3341\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadapuertasabiertaspioxii14/img_3342.jpg\" alt=\"img_3342\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadapuertasabiertaspioxii14/img_3343.jpg\" alt=\"img_3343\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadapuertasabiertaspioxii14/img_3344.jpg\" alt=\"img_3344\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadapuertasabiertaspioxii14/img_3345.jpg\" alt=\"img_3345\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadapuertasabiertaspioxii14/img_3346.jpg\" alt=\"img_3346\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r